---
layout: base.njk
title: The Directory
description: "The 1-2-3 of the Net: a human-curated directory of good, human-made websites."
---
<h1>The 1-2-3 of the Net</h1>
<p>Every link here is picked and checked by a person. &#9995; <b>Human-picked</b></p>

<table class="retro">
  <tr><th>Category</th><th>Sites</th></tr>
  {% for cat in directory.categories %}
  <tr id="{{ cat.slug }}">
    <td><b>{{ cat.name }}</b> ({{ cat.links | length }})<br><span class="small">{{ cat.blurb }}</span></td>
    <td>
      {% if cat.links | length %}
        <ul>{% for l in cat.links %}<li><a href="{{ l.url }}">{{ l.title }}</a>: {{ l.note }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      {% else %}<i class="small">Coming soon...</i>{% endif %}
    </td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

<p class="small">Know a great human-made site? Site submissions open soon.</p>
